beta = 28: PARITY FROZEN at beta L = 448. Every one of 10943 Q changes is even.
  The odd fraction is fixed during hot-start ordering and never moves again, so the
  independent parity draws are n_chains = 256 however long anything runs.
  binomial error 0.0312 -> z = -0.65; to halve it takes 1024 chains, and nothing else will.

